### 4. Testar login
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "bruno@gmail.com",
    "senha": "def"
}

### 5. Consultar clientepor ID
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 6. Consultar clientepor nome
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/buscar/Bruno
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 6. Listar clientes GET 
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 6. Excluir clientes
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}


